[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15802.87, "timestamp": "04:23:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15817.55, "timestamp": "04:23:37", "text": "我不知道該怎麼辦了。  再見。晚安。  你確定你該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15822.87, "timestamp": "04:23:42", "text": "復活嗎？我的天啊（音樂）。哇。回去。你的背回來了[音樂]。我死了。它運行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15824.95, "timestamp": "04:23:44", "text": "緩慢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15833.95, "timestamp": "04:23:53", "text": "遊戲卡頓得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15836.71, "timestamp": "04:23:56", "text": "厲害。我的天啊。  但我們確實在音樂方面取得了一些成就。"}]